# LS lists the mechanisms and PLAIN is not one: no AUTHENTICATE at all.
= auth sasl-plain
= account-password hunter2
= caps multi-prefix
> CAP LS 302
> NICK textual
> USER textual 0 * Textual
< :irc.example CAP * LS :multi-prefix sasl=EXTERNAL,SCRAM-SHA-256
> CAP REQ :multi-prefix sasl
< :irc.example CAP * ACK :multi-prefix sasl
> CAP END
? notice SASL failed: the server offers no mechanism we support (it offers EXTERNAL, SCRAM-SHA-256)
< :irc.example 001 textual :Welcome
? registered textual
